  character_Type: Mercenary
  character_Bio: "A bona fide tried-and-true career mercenary. Well-traveled and
    even better trained, equipped with the skills to play in the big leagues, you\u2019ve
    tackled numerous jobs with varying success rates but manage to come home breathing
    at the end. Your last gig left you worse for wear, and your previous crew has
    whispered about your failure. The criminal underground shuns you, worried you\u2019ll
    jinx the job. Now's your chance to reclaim your rep and score big."
